WEBVTT

00:08.270 --> 00:11.200
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:11.770 --> 00:14.830
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:15.480 --> 00:18.380
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.980 --> 00:21.950
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:22.580 --> 00:25.750
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:26.190 --> 00:29.210
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:29.790 --> 00:32.890
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:33.400 --> 00:36.020
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:36.930 --> 00:39.000
Don't be afraid

00:39.000 --> 00:40.500
Going from one push after another

00:40.500 --> 00:42.600
The surprising feeling is nice

00:42.600 --> 00:44.310
And you end up dancing till morning

00:44.310 --> 00:46.240
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:46.240 --> 00:49.610
TROPICANA

00:51.380 --> 00:54.470
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:55.150 --> 00:58.420
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:58.720 --> 01:01.750
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:02.320 --> 01:05.660
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:06.160 --> 01:09.030
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:09.600 --> 01:12.660
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:13.100 --> 01:16.200
The passion, the way it was born

01:16.810 --> 01:19.140
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:32.720 --> 01:34.720
I thought my body felt a little sluggish since
this morning.

01:34.720 --> 01:36.280
It looks like I have a fever now.

01:36.660 --> 01:37.490
Teacher?

01:37.560 --> 01:38.250
Haré is...

01:38.330 --> 01:39.360
Thanks, Guu.

01:39.360 --> 01:41.290
...being too noisy.
I can't concentrate on my studies.

01:42.160 --> 01:43.530
What do you mean, noisy!?

01:43.600 --> 01:44.900
You're noisy enough.

01:45.070 --> 01:47.300
Sir, I really feel awful right now!

01:47.770 --> 01:49.630
You look very much alive and well.

01:49.740 --> 01:50.800
I feel awful!

01:51.010 --> 01:51.560
I see...

01:52.070 --> 01:55.570
Well, if you say so, you must be.

01:55.880 --> 02:00.210
I should tell you,
"Go rest in the nurse's office..."

02:00.780 --> 02:02.440
But, you shouldn't do that.

02:03.080 --> 02:05.550
Yeah, the nurse's office...

02:06.120 --> 02:07.550
Is something wrong with it?

02:07.860 --> 02:11.090
Haré, you haven't met
the new school doctor, have you?

02:11.230 --> 02:13.850
He's someone that
came from the big city recently...

02:14.100 --> 02:15.690
Hey, hey. What's he like?

02:16.030 --> 02:20.230
Well, I don't hate
the doctor too much myself, but...

02:20.870 --> 02:24.500
That doc almost killed me
the moment I met him!

02:24.570 --> 02:26.400
He said he didn't like the way I looked at him!

02:26.540 --> 02:28.870
In any case,
kill before you get killed? Got that!?

02:29.310 --> 02:32.650
In my case, when I wanted to get a wound on
my finger disinfected...

02:32.650 --> 02:34.880
...he poured the antiseptic
right over my head!

02:35.320 --> 02:38.290
I didn't sense that much danger out of him.

02:38.650 --> 02:42.920
But he was rather friendly.
He sure was clingy in a strange way.

02:43.160 --> 02:44.960
That's called sexual harassment.

02:46.760 --> 02:49.750
He threw syringes at me, telling me to stop
laughing without reason!

02:51.500 --> 02:52.690
Um...

02:52.830 --> 02:56.670
And so, I think how you feel about him really
depends on who you are.

02:57.070 --> 02:58.100
Huh?

02:59.040 --> 03:00.060
Well, good luck.

03:00.410 --> 03:02.670
Hey! What's up with those sympathetic
looks?

03:02.910 --> 03:05.570
Hey, won't even one of you come with me?

03:09.620 --> 03:10.910
That means, the only one who's left...

03:14.020 --> 03:17.980
The Doctor in the Nurse's office

03:20.930 --> 03:23.420
Everyone is talking such nonsense.

03:23.630 --> 03:25.720
What should I do if the doctor is scary?

03:34.140 --> 03:35.040
Yes, come in.

03:36.580 --> 03:37.840
Excuse me.

03:42.080 --> 03:44.210
What? There's air conditioning in this room?

03:44.290 --> 03:45.450
Close that door.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.250
S-Sure.

03:49.520 --> 03:51.080
And, what do you want?

03:51.490 --> 03:55.450
Um, I haven't been feeling well, so I wanted
to rest here for a bit...

03:56.600 --> 03:57.570
You want to rest?

03:57.670 --> 03:58.720
Y-Yes...

04:02.940 --> 04:04.100
U-Um...

04:07.880 --> 04:08.900
I see.

04:08.980 --> 04:11.140
Since you're not feeling well, you might have
come down with a cold.

04:11.450 --> 04:12.280
Come here.

04:12.350 --> 04:14.540
You might have a fever, so I'll check you out.

04:21.060 --> 04:23.490
This seems different from what everyone
was telling me.

04:24.790 --> 04:26.920
He's a really nice person.

04:27.460 --> 04:29.050
You really do have a fever.

04:29.400 --> 04:31.230
I'll be using the stethoscope.
Lift your shirt up.

04:31.300 --> 04:32.160
S-Sure.

04:32.570 --> 04:33.760
Oh, that's right.

04:34.540 --> 04:35.470
What's your name?

04:36.070 --> 04:37.400
My name?

04:37.540 --> 04:38.160
Huh?

04:39.170 --> 04:40.970
Hey, what did you just say?

04:41.140 --> 04:42.070
"My"?

04:42.580 --> 04:43.340
U-Um...

04:43.810 --> 04:44.400
Wha-?

04:45.010 --> 04:45.880
You're a boy!

04:47.480 --> 04:49.310
Oh, this pisses me off!

04:49.380 --> 04:51.720
Don't be making such girly faces
if you're a guy!

04:51.820 --> 04:53.810
There's nothing more that I hate in this world
than guys with girly faces!

04:53.960 --> 04:56.320
I'm so tired now from
being kind without a reason!

04:56.420 --> 04:57.250
Hurry up and get out of here!

04:58.760 --> 04:59.620
What's wrong?

05:02.330 --> 05:06.130
Oh, am I going to be ending
my short life in a place like this?

05:06.330 --> 05:09.240
I beg you, please don't read other people's
minds without permission.

05:10.340 --> 05:11.360
Listen.

05:11.470 --> 05:14.440
If you die here, you'll make me feel guilty.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.770
Hurry up and go home, and die in your
house.

05:17.650 --> 05:19.110
You good-for-nothing quack.

05:19.410 --> 05:21.010
Huh? Did you say something?

05:21.180 --> 05:22.440
N-No, nothing.

05:25.820 --> 05:28.480
I guess I have to go home now.

05:29.390 --> 05:30.620
You know, Guu...

05:31.930 --> 05:33.890
I think Mom is going to be home today.

05:34.360 --> 05:37.530
Can you tell her that I can't move because of
a fever, and have her come here?

05:45.340 --> 05:46.830
Is your mom pretty?

05:46.940 --> 05:47.530
Huh?

05:47.880 --> 05:49.540
Not, "Huh?" Is she pretty?

05:49.880 --> 05:52.570
I-I think she's pretty.
She looks young for her age.

05:53.580 --> 05:55.210
Any other details?

05:55.280 --> 05:57.410
Hairstyle, body shape, age?

05:57.520 --> 05:59.990
H-Her hair is semi-long...

06:00.050 --> 06:00.750
Mm-hmm.

06:01.020 --> 06:02.060
Her bra size is F-cup.

06:02.060 --> 06:02.750
Oho!

06:02.860 --> 06:03.790
She's slender.

06:03.860 --> 06:04.720
Yeah, yeah!

06:04.890 --> 06:05.620
She's 25 years old.

06:06.090 --> 06:08.060
Oh! On top of that, she's married!

06:08.400 --> 06:12.300
Oh, Doctor, please stop.
I have a husband and child!

06:12.400 --> 06:15.300
Oh, but madame,
things like that don't matter!

06:15.570 --> 06:17.210
The situation is perfect!

06:17.210 --> 06:17.800
Huh?

06:17.910 --> 06:18.370
You pass!

06:18.970 --> 06:20.370
Pass what?

06:20.580 --> 06:22.810
I did some horrible things to you, didn't I...

06:22.880 --> 06:24.370
So, let's patch things up.

06:24.710 --> 06:25.700
Huh?

06:28.520 --> 06:29.880
That was awfully fast.

06:29.950 --> 06:30.980
Where's Mom?

06:32.020 --> 06:32.640
Here...

06:34.220 --> 06:35.990
Cheer up... . Mom

06:37.190 --> 06:38.780
What was Mom doing back home?

06:39.030 --> 06:40.550
Drinking. Completely plastered.

06:42.930 --> 06:44.520
Doctor...

06:45.070 --> 06:47.190
I have no need for you
if your mom isn't coming.

06:47.270 --> 06:47.960
Go home!

06:48.470 --> 06:50.840
A-At least give me some medicine.

06:57.480 --> 07:00.740
Um, can I have some cold medicine, please?

07:00.850 --> 07:03.510
All right,
I'll give you one that works really well.

07:03.620 --> 07:04.780
Oh, and a shot while you're at it?

07:04.850 --> 07:05.720
Sure, sure!

07:06.050 --> 07:09.550
But, in return, I want you to come visit me for
your physical exams when you grow up!

07:09.660 --> 07:10.390
Okay!

07:10.460 --> 07:11.080
Guu...

07:11.160 --> 07:14.690
I'm thankful for you, but I think I'm going to
get a stomach ulcer from all the complaints I
have about him.

07:15.730 --> 07:17.760
Have you had any allergies before?

07:18.030 --> 07:18.830
No.

07:18.930 --> 07:20.030
Then, you're fine.

07:21.540 --> 07:23.440
You need to relax until the fever dies down.

07:23.570 --> 07:25.540
Meanwhile, I'll spend my time with that girl...

07:25.670 --> 07:26.110
Huh?

07:26.270 --> 07:26.870
Huh?

07:26.940 --> 07:27.370
Huh?

07:27.440 --> 07:27.930
Huh?

07:28.310 --> 07:31.180
I guess he doesn't recognize Guu before her
transformation.

07:31.650 --> 07:32.480
Do you know where she went?

07:32.850 --> 07:34.910
I-I think she already went home.

07:39.820 --> 07:42.290
It's all right, really...

07:43.020 --> 07:44.360
I'm home.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.320
Welcome home, Haré!

07:46.890 --> 07:47.790
M-Mom?

07:48.330 --> 07:49.520
I've been worried about you!

07:49.900 --> 07:51.800
I'm sorry I couldn't go pick you up earlier.

07:52.100 --> 07:53.900
I love you. I love you very much!

07:54.600 --> 07:55.800
M-Mom...

07:56.200 --> 07:57.000
It's true.

07:57.340 --> 08:01.300
If something happened to you, Haré,
I don't know what I'd do.

08:01.580 --> 08:02.340
Mom...

08:02.410 --> 08:03.340
That means...

08:04.080 --> 08:08.010
If I'm no longer here, who would clean up
this cluttered room, doesn't it?

08:08.080 --> 08:09.010
Eheh...

08:09.080 --> 08:11.480
None of that "Eheh" thing!
You stink of booze!

08:11.720 --> 08:14.620
And so, the boy had no time to rest at all.

08:14.690 --> 08:16.320
You don't need to add explanations, either!

08:17.160 --> 08:18.150
The next day...

08:18.830 --> 08:20.890
Haré, I'm glad you got better.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.160
It's just that I don't have the time to be sick.

08:23.630 --> 08:25.360
Geez, my mom...

08:25.600 --> 08:27.690
She's always counting on me to do things.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.770
I'm jealous that she relies on you.

08:30.510 --> 08:33.170
I wish I had a mom
that would rely on me, too.

08:33.310 --> 08:35.280
Oh, sorry... I wasn't thinking.

08:35.610 --> 08:36.670
Don't worry about it.

08:36.780 --> 08:38.870
Haré, you don't have a father, right?

08:40.110 --> 08:41.740
I've never seen him.

08:41.950 --> 08:43.680
What kind of a man is your dad, Haré?

08:44.450 --> 08:48.290
Well... I've never heard anything about my
dad before.

08:48.760 --> 08:50.660
Mom doesn't talk about him, either.

08:50.790 --> 08:54.390
Oh? There must be something behind it,
if Weda isn't talking.

08:54.760 --> 08:55.890
Something behind it?

08:56.100 --> 08:58.730
That's right.
It's best if children didn't know about it.

08:58.830 --> 09:01.170
What's up with that
know-it-all tone of voice!?

09:01.670 --> 09:05.660
Oh, geez, now that you said it, I can't get it
out of my head!

09:05.840 --> 09:09.830
Or rather, Haré, you're the strange one for
never thinking about your father.

09:09.940 --> 09:11.040
That's true!

09:11.150 --> 09:12.170
Hey, Mom!

09:12.680 --> 09:13.700
There's something I want to ask you.

09:13.850 --> 09:15.840
We're having shrimp gratin for dinner.

09:15.920 --> 09:16.780
Oh, really!?

09:17.180 --> 09:18.990
Make sure to gut the shrimp.

09:18.990 --> 09:19.750
Okay!

09:19.890 --> 09:21.380
Wait! That's not it!

09:21.720 --> 09:23.380
Mom, don't I have a dad?

09:24.630 --> 09:26.650
Oh, Mom is surprised.

09:26.930 --> 09:28.560
There must be something behind it.

09:29.400 --> 09:32.130
If there wasn't a dad,
you wouldn't have been born.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.960
That's not what I mean!

09:34.100 --> 09:35.430
Then, what?

09:35.500 --> 09:36.200
You know...

09:36.200 --> 09:38.030
Why don't I have a dad right here?

09:39.210 --> 09:41.500
Let's see...

09:41.680 --> 09:42.470
I'm home.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.510
Oh, Guu! Welcome back!

09:44.580 --> 09:46.270
We're having shrimp gratin tonight!

09:46.610 --> 09:48.340
Don't change the subject!

09:49.180 --> 09:50.280
All right.

09:50.280 --> 09:51.650
You want a dad, don't you?

09:51.750 --> 09:53.740
No, it's not that I want one.

09:54.090 --> 09:54.780
Wait.

09:57.260 --> 09:58.050
Um...

09:58.160 --> 09:59.560
Now, which one do you want?

10:00.460 --> 10:01.690
No. 1, Lazy-sensei.

10:01.930 --> 10:02.790
No. 2, Chet.

10:03.130 --> 10:04.060
No. 3, Gupta.

10:04.370 --> 10:05.260
No. 4, Uighur.

10:05.600 --> 10:06.530
No. 5, Elder.

10:06.700 --> 10:07.690
No. 6, pokute.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.360
Now, which one do you want?

10:09.700 --> 10:10.730
Just a minute...

10:10.840 --> 10:12.500
Guu, which one do you want?

10:12.740 --> 10:13.370
No. 6.

10:13.470 --> 10:15.170
Oh my, the unexpected one!

10:15.280 --> 10:16.770
Hey now, what are you predicting!?

10:17.280 --> 10:19.250
So a pokute is Haré's father...

10:19.610 --> 10:20.950
Haré, here it comes!

10:25.620 --> 10:27.020
What's wrong, Haré?

10:27.490 --> 10:29.010
No! Anything but that!

10:29.090 --> 10:32.690
Really? Maybe it'd be fun if you got a
younger brother or sister?

10:32.830 --> 10:36.700
Yay! Together with big brother! Together with
big brother!

10:36.860 --> 10:37.990
They're harmonizing.

10:38.230 --> 10:39.670
Hey, are you all right?

10:39.770 --> 10:41.230
Geez, I've had enough of this!

10:41.440 --> 10:43.200
I'm seriously worried about things here!

10:43.270 --> 10:45.100
Why don't I have a dad!?

10:48.280 --> 10:50.640
Your father is living in the city.

10:52.280 --> 10:54.910
But, I don't know the details myself.

10:55.020 --> 10:58.580
He probably
doesn't know that you even exist.

10:59.020 --> 11:03.220
That's how far
we've gone our separate ways.

11:03.560 --> 11:05.580
Don't ask me any more than that.

11:07.060 --> 11:10.050
She's usually drinking all day and being a
useless drunken heap, but...

11:10.200 --> 11:12.460
If Mom is saying so much...

11:12.570 --> 11:14.560
What was that weird pause just now?

11:14.670 --> 11:17.510
Putting that aside,
at least tell me what he's like.

11:17.510 --> 11:19.000
Let's see...

11:19.510 --> 11:21.570
The worst guy... I think.

11:22.310 --> 11:23.070
The worst?

11:23.140 --> 11:24.300
Yeah, the worst!

11:24.410 --> 11:26.280
He's just an enemy to all women!

11:26.350 --> 11:29.110
My life got
torn into pieces because I met him!

11:30.750 --> 11:31.680
But...

11:32.190 --> 11:33.920
He did have good points.

11:34.020 --> 11:35.280
Eh? Like what?

11:35.820 --> 11:36.950
He was handsome!

11:37.960 --> 11:40.390
If you took away his looks,
he's nothing but a failure.

11:40.460 --> 11:41.690
That's the kind of person he was.

11:45.630 --> 11:47.500
For now, I kind of look like Mom.

11:47.600 --> 11:51.090
And so, you're going to
slowly start looking like a failure.

11:51.210 --> 11:53.830
Are you picking a fight with me?

11:56.840 --> 11:59.400
Things aren't exactly cleared up...

11:59.510 --> 12:02.180
Oh, I should ask someone that might know
something about this!

12:03.080 --> 12:04.640
Your dad, Haré?

12:04.850 --> 12:06.620
Anything will do. Tell me.

12:08.390 --> 12:10.360
Come to think of it,
I've heard something about him.

12:10.960 --> 12:11.930
What? What?

12:12.160 --> 12:13.350
Let's see, it was...

12:13.490 --> 12:15.460
...that he was a
high-ranking member of the mafia.

12:15.560 --> 12:16.360
R-Really?

12:16.500 --> 12:19.630
And when you were born, he got caught in
an internal struggle.

12:19.730 --> 12:20.500
Eh?!

12:20.630 --> 12:23.600
And he came running from the syndicate,
barely escaping with both you and his life.

12:23.670 --> 12:25.100
T-That's dramatic.

12:25.340 --> 12:29.710
But, come to think of it, you were born in this
village, so that sounds really fishy.

12:31.010 --> 12:33.000
Not only fishy, it's an outright lie.

12:33.180 --> 12:35.510
And, when she was telling me this story...

12:36.320 --> 12:38.680
Weda was really drunk,
so it might have been a joke.

12:39.050 --> 12:40.820
100% of that story is a joke.

12:40.890 --> 12:44.590
That means, the theory that a pokute is the
father is most likely...

12:44.690 --> 12:46.960
I beg you,
can you steer away from the pokutes?

12:48.130 --> 12:49.430
Haré's father?

12:49.560 --> 12:52.330
Yeah. I thought you might have heard
something about him, sir.

12:52.430 --> 12:54.130
I have, in a way.

12:54.200 --> 12:55.960
Really? Hey, what kind of story is it?

12:57.810 --> 13:00.040
Can I really tell you this?

13:00.170 --> 13:01.470
Please, sir!

13:02.810 --> 13:05.440
Then, you need to keep it a secret that I told
you this.

13:06.580 --> 13:07.310
Yeah.

13:09.520 --> 13:10.710
You know...

13:10.950 --> 13:13.080
Eleven years ago,
on her way back from school...

13:13.150 --> 13:15.250
...she was showered with a strange light...

13:15.690 --> 13:18.060
...and was taken away somewhere...

13:19.830 --> 13:23.160
...and when she came back,
she was pregnant.

13:23.460 --> 13:24.230
You're kidding.

13:24.530 --> 13:27.590
But, Weda was drinking at the time,
so it may have been a joke.

13:27.670 --> 13:28.640
It is a joke!

13:28.740 --> 13:29.430
No...

13:29.900 --> 13:31.340
...it might be true.

13:31.670 --> 13:33.610
You think you might
know something about it?

13:33.840 --> 13:36.210
In other words, the alien was a pokute.

13:36.310 --> 13:38.370
That way, all the mysteries are...

13:38.450 --> 13:39.310
...Not solved!

13:39.480 --> 13:41.380
Just get your mind away from the pokutes!

13:41.980 --> 13:45.470
Geez, at this rate I won't find out anything
about my father.

13:45.650 --> 13:46.550
What!?

13:46.720 --> 13:48.240
You don't have a father!?

13:48.590 --> 13:50.890
That means, what, your mother is a widow!?

13:50.990 --> 13:53.120
No, I think she probably got divorced.

13:53.230 --> 13:54.130
Divorce!?

13:54.330 --> 13:55.200
You're kidding me!

13:55.200 --> 13:56.390
She's not someone's wife!?

13:56.460 --> 13:57.130
If that's true...

13:57.130 --> 13:59.630
"Oh, my husband will be returning soon."

13:59.630 --> 14:01.160
"No, no, we're still fine."

14:01.240 --> 14:03.600
That plan is all in ruins!

14:04.040 --> 14:07.300
Geez,
don't plan for the ruin of someone's family.

14:07.410 --> 14:10.870
You know, what did your mom tell you about
your father?

14:11.480 --> 14:13.780
That he was the worst failure.

14:13.850 --> 14:15.680
A failure, eh?

14:16.580 --> 14:18.810
Are you trying to pick a fight with me,
by looking this way?

14:18.920 --> 14:19.940
No, no.

14:20.290 --> 14:23.280
Well, from what I gather, maybe he was some
horrible gigolo.

14:23.720 --> 14:25.020
Gigolo?

14:25.290 --> 14:27.190
There really are terrible men out there.

14:28.260 --> 14:29.390
What's with that look?

14:29.500 --> 14:30.430
No, no, no.

14:30.730 --> 14:31.560
By the way...

14:32.170 --> 14:35.000
This means that you're no longer interested
in Mom, right, Doctor?

14:36.300 --> 14:36.740
Yeah.

14:36.800 --> 14:38.970
What was that pause
that I couldn't help but notice?

14:39.210 --> 14:42.610
Geez! Don't you come to my house just
because my mom is free to date people!

14:42.910 --> 14:47.240
Even though I like women more than the
average person, I wouldn't go that far.

14:47.380 --> 14:50.150
But, when you're told not to come over, you
want to come over even more, right?

14:50.220 --> 14:50.950
Yup, yup.

14:51.290 --> 14:54.220
I won't go! Honest!

14:55.960 --> 14:56.950
He's going to head over.

14:57.020 --> 14:57.550
Yeah.

15:01.230 --> 15:02.720
Hey, how about this?

15:02.800 --> 15:04.860
Oh, isn't that a bit big?

15:07.170 --> 15:10.140
Mom is always happy-go-lucky,
and seems airheaded.

15:10.800 --> 15:13.600
But I'm sure something horrible happened
between her and Dad.

15:14.640 --> 15:18.170
Maybe I wasn't supposed to ask her about
Dad.

15:30.120 --> 15:34.460
That's right!
Even if Dad isn't around, I still have Mom!

15:35.860 --> 15:36.690
Excuse me.

15:39.270 --> 15:40.230
Excuse me!?

15:40.630 --> 15:41.970
I've seen you a lot today.

15:43.070 --> 15:46.730
Hey, you! If you can't greet people, you won't
end up a decent adult!

15:48.140 --> 15:52.170
Are you a decent adult, you pale perverted
school doctor?

15:52.650 --> 15:54.200
I'm going to protect Mom!

15:54.350 --> 15:55.320
...is what he's saying.

15:55.420 --> 15:56.140
Oh?

15:56.320 --> 15:57.940
I didn't say it. I didn't say it.

15:58.390 --> 16:02.580
You know, I didn't think you had such
expectations of me.

16:02.890 --> 16:04.120
E-Expectations?

16:04.220 --> 16:06.190
At that rate, I'll just have to whisk her away.

16:06.960 --> 16:08.430
Now, where is your mom?

16:08.960 --> 16:11.090
You've gotten me this aroused...

16:11.270 --> 16:14.170
If your mom isn't beautiful, I'll kill you!

16:14.970 --> 16:16.200
Haré!

16:17.400 --> 16:18.440
Can you help me carry the snacks?

16:18.440 --> 16:19.340
Don't come over here right now!
Can you help me carry the snacks?

16:19.340 --> 16:20.200
Don't come over here right now!

16:21.110 --> 16:22.870
Can it be?

16:23.540 --> 16:24.600
Weda? Dr. Clive?

16:25.450 --> 16:26.940
What? You know each other?

16:27.250 --> 16:30.880
Yeah. He's the doctor that I went to back
when I was living in the city.

16:30.950 --> 16:32.580
That's right, I took care of her.

16:32.690 --> 16:34.240
Geez, Doctor!

16:34.360 --> 16:36.820
But, I almost didn't
recognize you with your white hair!

16:36.920 --> 16:38.260
You must have had hard times.

16:38.330 --> 16:40.230
Oh no, this is on purpose.

16:40.290 --> 16:40.990
It's fashionable.

16:41.060 --> 16:41.990
Oh!

16:42.260 --> 16:45.820
Where do I stand, after trying so hard to keep
them from meeting?

16:46.030 --> 16:47.590
You're a clown, so to speak.

16:47.700 --> 16:48.860
You don't have to be so blunt.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.240
But, you know...

16:52.240 --> 16:52.970
Haré!

16:53.640 --> 16:54.500
Come here a sec.

16:55.840 --> 16:56.640
What?

16:56.810 --> 16:59.240
Weda knows that school doctor?

16:59.350 --> 16:59.970
Yeah.

17:00.110 --> 17:02.050
She said he's the doctor that used to take
care of her.

17:04.550 --> 17:05.980
The world is a small place...

17:06.590 --> 17:08.710
To think that the brat's mother was Weda...

17:09.020 --> 17:13.260
But still, she's grown in all sorts of places in
a healthy way!

17:13.730 --> 17:15.490
She sure changed...

17:16.530 --> 17:19.660
She was so weak back then.

17:22.540 --> 17:24.230
Doctor, what's wrong?

17:24.300 --> 17:26.360
Oh, no, nothing, nothing at all.

17:27.140 --> 17:28.900
Doctor, you're the same as always.

17:29.610 --> 17:31.200
I don't know why, but this irritates me!

17:31.450 --> 17:32.670
A clown with an Oedipus complex.

17:34.250 --> 17:36.340
Stop with that eerie laugh!

17:36.620 --> 17:39.950
But, it was unexpected
that you'd have a kid, Weda.

17:40.150 --> 17:41.820
What kind of guy is the father?

17:41.890 --> 17:42.620
It's you, Doctor.

17:50.560 --> 17:51.760
Oh, so it was just a joke!

17:54.940 --> 17:55.960
Hey, Doctor...

17:56.040 --> 17:56.470
Hm?

17:56.570 --> 17:58.010
Nothing comes to mind?

17:58.010 --> 17:58.700
Something does.

18:00.840 --> 18:02.140
A lot of something.

18:04.710 --> 18:06.700
So that's your father.

18:08.820 --> 18:09.440
Here.

18:10.780 --> 18:11.580
Go!

18:12.620 --> 18:14.180
M-Mom...

18:14.960 --> 18:15.920
Is that really true?

18:16.820 --> 18:17.690
Haré...

18:18.430 --> 18:20.290
This is your papa.

18:20.390 --> 18:21.990
So, I'm your papa.

18:24.400 --> 18:25.920
Tears of joy...

18:26.030 --> 18:27.800
I-I don't think that's it.

18:31.510 --> 18:32.370
Haré?

18:33.040 --> 18:33.630
Haré!

18:35.180 --> 18:36.970
It's a lie!

18:37.210 --> 18:38.910
A lie, a lie, a lie!

18:39.010 --> 18:40.600
Of all guys, someone like him!?

18:40.680 --> 18:42.210
Someone like him!?

18:45.550 --> 18:49.990
Why is someone
as scummy as that guy my dad?

18:52.330 --> 18:57.700
If that guy, if someone like him is my father,
I'd rather have a pokute for a father!

19:02.700 --> 19:05.100
How about it? You want to play catch?

19:06.510 --> 19:09.110
I would like to have a human dad after all.

19:09.110 --> 19:09.600
Damn.

19:11.250 --> 19:12.940
What did you come here for?

19:13.510 --> 19:15.240
You came here to drag me back?

19:16.080 --> 19:17.710
I came here to see you cry, Haré.

19:17.990 --> 19:18.580
Go home!

19:18.650 --> 19:19.380
What about you, Haré?

19:19.450 --> 19:20.610
I'm not going to go back anymore!

19:20.720 --> 19:22.550
Where are you going to go,
after leaving your house?

19:22.620 --> 19:25.220
I think I'll have Marie put me up for a while.

19:25.590 --> 19:26.890
Are you a free-loader?

19:27.190 --> 19:28.250
What's that supposed to mean?

19:28.830 --> 19:30.390
Why are you running away from home?

19:30.930 --> 19:33.700
It's shocking that
the school doctor was my dad.

19:33.800 --> 19:35.360
But Mom is acting funny.

19:35.500 --> 19:39.060
She said that he was the worst guy, but she's
being so friendly to him when she talks...

19:39.940 --> 19:42.270
I don't want to see Mom right now.

19:42.580 --> 19:46.880
Besides, I don't know what happened
between them in the past...

19:46.880 --> 19:48.140
...but it looks like
they might get back together.

19:48.250 --> 19:49.180
You don't like that?

19:49.250 --> 19:50.220
I don't like it.

19:54.960 --> 19:58.080
Oh man, I don't need a father.

19:58.930 --> 20:01.190
As long as I have Mom, that's all I need.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.830
Haré...

20:04.930 --> 20:07.130
...you don't like
having both parents at your side?

20:09.400 --> 20:12.960
Come to think of it, Guu came to our house
because both of her parents died.

20:16.380 --> 20:19.500
Um, I'm sorry for complaining so much.

20:20.180 --> 20:23.240
You must be feeling more pain, Guu,
because you lost your parents.

20:23.950 --> 20:25.150
Oh, that's right.

20:25.820 --> 20:27.680
I configured things that way.

20:27.820 --> 20:29.580
What do you mean by "configured?"

20:29.860 --> 20:30.750
Don't worry about it.

20:30.820 --> 20:31.720
I will worry!

20:32.360 --> 20:33.880
Oh, well.

20:34.160 --> 20:37.190
Guu cheered me up in a way...

20:38.830 --> 20:41.200
Let's go back to where Mom is.

20:41.340 --> 20:42.170
Huh?

20:42.270 --> 20:43.700
Haré, you're going to
run away from home, right?

20:44.740 --> 20:46.070
Live a strong life.

20:46.170 --> 20:48.970
W-Wait a minute!

20:51.950 --> 20:53.540
Mom is back already!

20:56.480 --> 20:57.750
I'm home!

21:03.820 --> 21:05.720
I'm home!

21:06.490 --> 21:11.430
I'm asking you, how about we fill in the ten
year gap in my room tonight?

21:12.470 --> 21:15.370
Doctor, your mind is full of it now, just like
back then!

21:15.440 --> 21:17.230
No, don't laugh it off.

21:17.640 --> 21:19.300
I'm serious, Weda-chan.

21:21.780 --> 21:23.870
Made your mind up
to run away from home yet?

22:35.580 --> 22:36.420
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.420 --> 22:38.390
Huh? You want me to bathe with you, Mom?

22:38.390 --> 22:39.820
I don't want to! I'm already 10 years old!

22:39.820 --> 22:41.420
I'm no longer a small child,
so I'm going to bathe alone!

22:41.420 --> 22:42.720
Oh geez, don't throw a tantrum!

22:42.720 --> 22:44.090
Are you really the mother of a child?

22:44.090 --> 22:45.730
But, well, since Guu came here, Mom's attachment
has gone towards her, so it's gotten a little easier.

22:45.730 --> 22:46.730
But, well, since Guu came here, Mom's attachment
has gone towards her, so it's gotten a little easier.

22:46.730 --> 22:48.760
Mom really likes to cling to people...

22:48.760 --> 22:51.130
Hey, wait, Guu!
Why are you bathing with your clothes on!?

22:51.130 --> 22:52.330
Don't do such creepy things!

22:52.330 --> 22:55.100
Eh? It's the latest fad in the jungle to bathe
with your clothes on?

22:55.100 --> 22:57.100
You're kidding. But, to see if it's true...

22:57.100 --> 22:58.440
Eh? There's a good way to do it? What is it?

22:58.440 --> 22:59.770
Bathe together with a girl?

22:59.770 --> 23:00.540
I see, that's a good thought...
Wait I can't do such a thing!

23:00.540 --> 23:02.080
I see that's a good thought... Wait I can't do such a thing!

23:02.080 --> 23:02.340
Viva Non-Non

23:02.340 --> 23:05.570
Next episode of Haré+Guu: Viva Non-Non.
